WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.300
AI tutors: Every message is screened at the student's grade band.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:10.300
Grade 1: Young learners answer by voice and drawing.

3
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:15.300
Teachers: A score is official only when the teacher approves it.

4
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:20.300
Open courses: A full semester from a signed course package.

5
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:25.300
Families: Families see what teachers share, never more.

6
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:30.300
District office: The district owns the system and the data.
